    "detailed_description": "In ItsyRealm, you're on an awesome quest to discover the secrets of a necromancer god only known as the Empty King. Fight, explore, craft, and quest your way through this single-player-focused cutesy RPG.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/9ff8d2a8aff645394df6027603655bf7.poster.avif?t=1744937356\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/9ff8d2a8aff645394df6027603655bf7.webm?t=1744937356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Along your way, you'll have to think on your feet using staff, sword, and bow to fight mythical monsters and eldritch abominations! You can switch your class even in the middle of battle to exploit openings in your foe's defenses! All the while strategically using special attacks and defensive abilities to slay your foes before they slay you...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/deb4e73be585f928d00d13164c620d64.poster.avif?t=1744937356\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/deb4e73be585f928d00d13164c620d64.webm?t=1744937356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Use 21 skills to gather, craft, and wield powerful equipment from dangerous dungeons, teeming forests, ancient ruins, the open sea, and more! Mine those ores, cut those trees, and fish those fish using gathering skills. Then craft them into weapons, armor, and food using artisan skills and wield them using your combat skills!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/0178bb89dda40b240ee77ef32937b2c6.poster.avif?t=1744937356\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/0178bb89dda40b240ee77ef32937b2c6.webm?t=1744937356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Help a bunch of like-minded adventurers achieve their own victories! Decisions must be made during your adventure on who to help, who to fight, and who to betray - think wisely or you might just be alone when you face The Empty King!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/b2f0757916dcc43982e8b14297328a3f.poster.avif?t=1744937356\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/b2f0757916dcc43982e8b14297328a3f.webm?t=1744937356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Be your authentic self with tons of customization options!",
    "about_the_game": "In ItsyRealm, you're on an awesome quest to discover the secrets of a necromancer god only known as the Empty King. Fight, explore, craft, and quest your way through this single-player-focused cutesy RPG.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/9ff8d2a8aff645394df6027603655bf7.poster.avif?t=1744937356\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/9ff8d2a8aff645394df6027603655bf7.webm?t=1744937356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Along your way, you'll have to think on your feet using staff, sword, and bow to fight mythical monsters and eldritch abominations! You can switch your class even in the middle of battle to exploit openings in your foe's defenses! All the while strategically using special attacks and defensive abilities to slay your foes before they slay you...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/deb4e73be585f928d00d13164c620d64.poster.avif?t=1744937356\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/deb4e73be585f928d00d13164c620d64.webm?t=1744937356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Use 21 skills to gather, craft, and wield powerful equipment from dangerous dungeons, teeming forests, ancient ruins, the open sea, and more! Mine those ores, cut those trees, and fish those fish using gathering skills. Then craft them into weapons, armor, and food using artisan skills and wield them using your combat skills!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/0178bb89dda40b240ee77ef32937b2c6.poster.avif?t=1744937356\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/0178bb89dda40b240ee77ef32937b2c6.webm?t=1744937356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Help a bunch of like-minded adventurers achieve their own victories! Decisions must be made during your adventure on who to help, who to fight, and who to betray - think wisely or you might just be alone when you face The Empty King!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/b2f0757916dcc43982e8b14297328a3f.poster.avif?t=1744937356\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662510/extras/b2f0757916dcc43982e8b14297328a3f.webm?t=1744937356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Be your authentic self with tons of customization options!",
    "short_description": "Start as a newbie adventurer getting beat down by bumbling zombis. But in the blink of an eye, you\u2019ll be crafting awesome weapons to bash and slash Lovecraftian Old Ones. Make your own way in a world of secret societies and cryptic cults, where nothing is straightforward and no one can be trusted.",
